# Desktop SECRETS — DEV.  Copy to `.env.dev.sec`, fill in, then:
#   npm run env:encrypt:dev     (commits .env.dev.sec.enc; plaintext stays local)
# Never commit the plaintext. These are the truly-sensitive values.

# Tauri updater artifact signing (auto-update feed). Generate the keypair once:
#   npx @tauri-apps/cli signer generate -w ~/.tauri/conva.key
# Paste the PRIVATE key here; add the matching PUBLIC key to
# src-tauri/tauri.conf.json → plugins.updater.pubkey. Until this is set, dev
# installers still build — only the auto-update packages are skipped.
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PASSWORD=
